{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026epx79xfNFB1795530571.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>由共享基金會出資拍攝的中醫藥紀錄片《未見之身》，舉行全球首映。</p><p></p><p>全國政協副主席、共享基金會主席梁振英說：「這套電影用西方視角，客觀用英文全球通用的語言，向國外介紹中醫中藥跟西醫西藥作比較。我們知道中醫中藥是中華文明的瑰寶，我們要做好傳承、創新、發展的工作，我們很希望能跟全世界的傳統醫藥作文明互鑑。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MOVIE-2200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yTfsYUaoCz1795530698.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>電影由英皇電影及美亞娛樂聯合製作。攝製隊走訪香港和廣州的醫院，以及多間頂尖醫學院，如哈佛醫學院、牛津大學，耶魯大學等拍攝，見證科學家重新檢視古老的醫學智慧。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.878973+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:12.895209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:18.857167+00:00","content_hash":"1a54c19ee4730ad16a6928169ca21daa005db30e4b148cde9ebd113e3f0f7be5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.878973+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}